  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Hints: } \\mathrm{A} \\equiv(2,4) ; \\mathrm{C} \\equiv(2,-4) ; \\mathrm{B} \\equiv(-2,-4) \\\\\n& |A B|=\\sqrt{(2-(-2))^2+(4-(-4))^2}=\\sqrt{4^2+8^2} \\\\\n& =\\sqrt{16+64}=\\sqrt{80}=\\sqrt{16 \\times 5}=4 \\sqrt{5}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/tKXdNA_L8PJwc1FW0iuBG2zvzwotcMOsEHe4K-5wZBg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
